          "usfm": "1TH.1.1",
          "note_ref": "1:1",
          "note_type": "footnote",
          "references": [],
          "text": "Greek Silvanus, a variant of Silas"
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "1TH.1.4",
          "note_ref": "1:4",
          "note_type": "footnote",
          "references": [],
          "text": "The Greek word for brothers and sisters (adelphoi) refers here to believers, both men and women, as part of God’s family; also in 2:1, 9, 14, 17; 3:7; 4:1, 10, 13; 5:1, 4, 12, 14, 25, 27."
        }
      ],
